    "updated_at": "2019-08-29T16:45:16Z",
    "body": "The icon can be configured with the `jobs.symbol` key in `~/.config/starship.toml`:\r\n```toml\r\n# ~/.config/starship.toml\r\n\r\n[jobs]\r\nsymbol = \"😸\"\r\n```",
